title: BirdTutorial
---
<<once>>
    <<declare $firstRecipe = false>>
    <<declare $turnOnMixer = false>>
    <<declare $mixingComplete = false>>
    <<declare $turnOffMixer = false>>
    <<declare $doughOnBoard = false>>
    <<declare $kneadDough = false>>
    <<declare $openOven = false>>
    <<declare $doughsOnOven = false>>
    <<declare $turnOnOven = false>>
    <<declare $heatingComplete = false>>
    <<declare $turnOffOven = false>>
    <<declare $tutorialComplete = false>>

    Periquito: Chirp-chirp! Good morning! Wee-oo!
    Periquito: Josepeh! Peeep!.
    Periquito: Love you! Doo-doo!
    Periquito: Let's make! Scree. Bread!
    Periquito: Look! Peep! Recepies! Chirp!
    Periquito: On the board!
    <<wait  1>>
    <<start_tutorial Periquito>>
<<else>>
    <<if !$firstRecipe>>
        <<jump FirstRecipe>>
    <<elseif !$turnOnMixer>>
        <<jump TurnOnMixer>>
    <<elseif !$mixingComplete>>
        <<jump MixingComplete>>
    <<elseif !$turnOffMixer>>
        <<jump TurnOffMixer>>
    <<elseif !$doughOnBoard>>
        <<jump DoughOnBoard>>
    <<elseif !$kneadDough>>     
        <<jump KneadDough>>
    <<elseif !$openOven>>       
        <<jump OpenOven>>
    <<elseif !$doughsOnOven>>
        <<jump DoughsOnOven>>
    <<elseif !$turnOnOven>>
        <<jump TurnOnOven>>
    <<elseif !$heatingComplete>>
        <<jump HeatingComplete>>
    <<elseif !$turnOffOven>>
        <<jump TurnOffOven>>
    <<elseif !$tutorialComplete>>
        <<jump TutorialComplete>>
    <<endif>>
<<endonce>>
